# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# The one exception: a throwaway key that signs the ".ci" build only.
# It is public on purpose so that consecutive CI builds share a
# certificate and can install over one another. It is not the real key,
# and nothing it signs may be published.
!ci-signing/ci.keystore
